<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan money market rates stay at high levels.</title>
<headline>Pakistan money market rates stay at high levels.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's money market rates stayed at high levels on Tuesday amid a paucity of funds, dealers said.</p>
<p>Most of the business was done between 19.50 and 19.90 percent, a dealer at Khadim Ali Shah Bukhari &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>One-month bids and offers were quoted at 16 and 16.50 percent respectively, he said. Few lenders managed to place some funds at 16.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
